{"title":"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What are all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/0/3603dec841e6c7752113de4aafcf98beee2e55bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{9} = \\frac{25}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"63\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Cross multiplying, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/9/02928633e715a353b5e506931642d02b776ceae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\times n = 9 \\times 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"120\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/b/54ba8983bbe6c3f751cfd50b11a5ae77116ee7fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{2} = 225$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/2/8d2c74603eda04780fed557acad25f26aee44591.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\pm \\sqrt{225} = \\pm 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"150\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec695348c7cdd4676d973357d106f40143f76b7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{n = -15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"81\" height=\"26\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/3/cd3c296951e4d3ce3dfada33a3855e333a973048.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{n = 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"66\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018001930\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 35/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1311/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.787      1 2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    5.787      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35965:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018001930 and revision id 279531. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}